Did you try to copy the 1 and drop it on the C?

Did you copy the box with the D?

Did you copy the 1 again to turn one of the Ds into an E?

Did you copy the box with the E?

Have you been combining the boxes to make a box with A, B, C, D, and E?

Did you drop the 1 on the E in the box?

Did you join the box with the F in it to the other box?

OK, what I would do first is take out the box with the A, B and C and
set it down.  Then I'd copy the 1 and drop it on the box with
the C.  Then I'd copy the box with the D and join it to the end of
the box with A, B, and C.  I'd do it again to make a box with E and
I'd join that making a box with A, B, C, D and E.  Then I'd drop the
1 on the box with the E.  I'd take the box with the F and join it to
the other and pick up the result.


